# Context Stream index

This register locates active threads and completed capsules. Messages remain in role-owned outboxes; durable knowledge remains in canonical project files.

## Endpoints

| Context | Outbox | Recipient state |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Research | `research/outbox/` | `research/state.md` |
| Operations | `operations/outbox/` | `operations/state.md` |
| Verification | `verification/outbox/` | `verification/state.md` |

The human user receives complete Verification Findings directly and has no agent-owned cursor or outbox. The human user decides whether a finding is disclosed or routed to Research or Operations.

